# =====================================================================
# This repository is the PUBLIC half of a benchmark whose corpus, answer
# keys and rule definitions are deliberately withheld. Everything below
# either is private material or is a place private material lands. Adding
# a path here is cheaper than removing it from history later.
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------- private benchmark material
# Generated item sets: every item carries its gold answer.
data/
items-v*.json
*-items.json

# Family 4's holdout targets and pool: every target carries ground truth.
holdout-*.json
holdout-*.jsonl

# Answer keys, verdict sheets and anything named like one.
ANSWERS.md
ANSWERS*.md
*-ANSWERS.md
answers.json
gold*.json
*-gold.json
demo-inputs/

# Rule definitions supplied beside the private pool. The harness reads these
# when present and runs without them; they must never be committed here.
config/boundary_gaps.json
config/lever_fields.yaml

# Build reports and pre-registration: these describe rule behaviour in prose.
PRE-REGISTRATION.md
BUILD-REPORT.md
build-report*.md
benchmark-report.md
capacity-delta*.md
degeneracy*.md
leak-check*.md
phase*-*.md
phase*-*.txt
implementation-notes.md
CAPACITY.md
capacity.json

# The corpus itself, if it is ever checked out or linked inside this tree.
corpus/
corpus-v*/
ledger-v*/
sediment-corpus/

# ---------------------------------------------------- run output
results/
logs/
*.log
summary.json
report.md

# ---------------------------------------------------- secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
credentials.json
secrets.*
.netrc

# ---------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/

# ---------------------------------------------------- editors / os
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------- agent tooling
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
